{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116994","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116994/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116994/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116994/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116994","id":4014031038,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7vQUC-","number":116994,"title":"AnimationPlayer - Crash when calling clear_queue() on a starting a queued animation","user":{"login":"French-Asgeir","id":109287366,"node_id":"U_kgDOBoOXxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109287366?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/French-Asgeir","html_url":"https://github.com/French-Asgeir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/French-Asgeir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/French-Asgeir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/French-Asgeir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/French-Asgeir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/French-Asgeir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/French-Asgeir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/French-Asgeir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/French-Asgeir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/French-Asgeir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-03-03T00:30:11Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T08:34:45Z","closed_at":"2026-03-05T08:34:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.6.1.stable.official [14d19694e], v4.6.stable.official [89cea1439]\n- Not reproducible in: v4.5.stable.official [876b29033]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT (RADV NAVI22) - AMD Ryzen 7 5700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.25 Gio memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI needed to play an animation and sometime queue another one while the first one was playing. To ensure the queued animation wasn't played multiple time, I cleared the animation queue at every animation start. I also had logic to play (not queue) another animation at each animation end in case nothing was queued.\n\nIt possible to prevent crash by deferring clear_queue()\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node3D\n\n@onready var animation_player: AnimationPlayer = %AnimationPlayer\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tanimation_player.animation_started.connect(on_anim_started)\n\tanimation_player.animation_finished.connect(on_anim_finished)\n\t\n\tanimation_player.play(\"anim_1\")\n\tanimation_player.queue(\"anim_2\")\n\nfunc on_anim_started(_anim_name: StringName) -> void:\n\tanimation_player.clear_queue()\n\nfunc on_anim_finished(_anim_name: StringName) -> void:\n\tanimation_player.play(\"anim_1\")\n```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Archive.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25698365/Archive.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116994/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/1169